    "For the widest game support, enable Apple's D3DMetal graphics translator by accepting its licence below. Without it, some games, including DirectX 12 games, will not start. Setup reuses an installed engine or downloads it (up to %@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für möglichst viele kompatible Spiele aktivieren Sie Apples Grafikübersetzer D3DMetal, indem Sie unten die Lizenz akzeptieren. Ohne ihn starten einige Spiele nicht, darunter auch DirectX-12-Spiele. Die Einrichtung verwendet eine vorhandene Engine oder lädt sie herunter (bis zu %@)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour une compatibilité optimale, activez le traducteur graphique D3DMetal d’Apple en acceptant sa licence ci-dessous. Sans lui, certains jeux ne démarrent pas, notamment des jeux DirectX 12. La configuration réutilise un moteur installé ou le télécharge (jusqu’à %@)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For the widest game support, enable Apple's D3DMetal graphics translator by accepting its licence below. Without it, some games, including DirectX 12 games, will not start. Setup reuses an installed engine or downloads it (up to %@)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For the widest game support, enable Apple's D3DMetal graphics translator by accepting its licence below. Without it, some games, including DirectX 12 games, will not start. Setup reuses an installed engine or downloads it (up to %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
